                                "sense_id": "802a9f47-e9d8-3ac7-9ff4-91e9acb14915",
                                "text": "Their slanted representations, and even the selective acceptance practised by scientists who were also devout Catholics, produced a variety of readings and even nonreadings of Darwin's texts which obscured the science behind the theory."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9422e1b9-882d-486c-af95-174150291e54",
                                "sense_id": "802a9f47-e9d8-3ac7-9ff4-91e9acb14915",
                                "text": "Then why, he was asked, did he write a book that seems to justify nonreading?"
